    "stem": "Esha builds a row of hexagon houses with drinking straws. Shape $1$ uses $6$ straws, Shape $2$ uses $11$ straws, and Shape $3$ uses $16$ straws.\n\nWhich countable feature produces the related number sequence $6$, $11$, $16$, $\\ldots$?",
