    "options": {
      "A": "Count the straws that make up each whole shape; repeating that same count gives $6$, $11$, $16$, $\\ldots$.",
      "B": "Count the straws in Shape $1$ only, then reuse that same count for every later shape.",
      "C": "Count every interior angle from any polygon in the chapter, as if that also made this sequence.",
      "D": "Pick the printed numeral $16$ alone because it is the largest number shown."
